<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id">Zephaniah</book>
  <para style="h">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zephaniah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zephaniah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda leengpa Amon tapa Josiah hunlai a, Hezekiah tapa Amariah, Amariah tapa Gedaliah, Gedaliah tapa Kushi, Kushi tapa Zephaniah kunga Mangpa thu hing tung khu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Leitung a um sil zousie ka phietmang sieng ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Keima’n mi leh sa ka phietmang dinga, Vanlaizawl aleengvate leh tuipi a ngate, tualeh migilou mi kipalpuasahte pumin, ka phietmang ding a, Leitung akipat in mihing ka sattan ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Juda douna leh Jerusalem a, tengte zousie douna in ka khut ka laam ding a, tam mun akipat in Baal umnalaite leh, milim bie siempute leh lawkite siempute, min ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Inntungvum lah a vanlaizawl a aasi bie a kunte, leh Mangpa bie a amin a kihahsiel a kichiemte, hinanleh Milkom min siel a zong kichiemte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa nuazuilai kinuaheisante leh, Mangpa suilou, kan zong kanvateh loute ka phietmang ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa Pasian masang ah sipkhinkhian un, Mangpa ni anai tah ziehin, Mangpa’n kithoina aguong zouta a, Amichielte asusiengthouzouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa kithoina ni ah tambang ahi ding, “Milien milalte, leengpa tate, leh gamdang puon a kizemte zousie, ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ni main phuol tunga kitawm kawite zousie leh, hiemngapna leh lepchiena a, apute uh inn dimsahte, ka gawt ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, “Tua ni chiengin” Nga kotpi a kipat in, “Daa leh kaana husa akiza dinga, Umna Nina lam a kipat mauna, Tualeh muol lam akipat in puana, ging ngaitah a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou Maktesh a tengte kap in mau un, aziehpen summetbawl mite zousie, suhmangin a umta ua, sum a summet bawlte zousie, sattan in aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin ken meivah de in, Jerusalem ka suidoh ding a, khophawh lou a, lungkimtah a um a, alungtang ua, Mangpa’n silhoi abawl sih ding a, sil hoilou zong abawl sih ding chi mite, ka gawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin anei alamte uh gallah vante ahing hi dinga, a innte uh ahawm in akinuasie ding hi. Innte abawl ding ua, hinanleh aluo sih ding uhi; grep huonte abawl ding ua, hinanleh grep zu adawn sih ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa ni thupi anaita a, anaiin akinaw mama ta hi. Mangpa ni a kaana husa ahuoisie hi, khunah mihatte akap hut hut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuani khu thangpaina ni ahia, Lungzin lungkhamna ni ahi, buoina leh sietna ni ahi a, mielna leh lungkiehna ni ahi, meilum kai a mielna thupi ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kulpi nei khopite leh galvenna innsangte, douna a pengkul ginni leh, kigal ginna ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa tunga akheltah ziehun, mite tungah lunggimna ka tungsah dinga, mittote bangin avah ding ua, a sisan uh leivui bangin akibokhe dinga, atahsa uh eeh bang mai a pai ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mangpa thangpaina ni ah, adangka uleh asanate un, ahunkhe theisih ding hi; Hinanleh gam pumpi a thangsietna, meiin akatum ding hi; Aziehpen Aman agam sunga teng mi zousie, kintah in asubei pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kikhawm un, Ahi, kikhawm un, Aw nou zumna theilou namte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thutanna ahing tun masangin, Bushi banga lenmangna ni abei masangin, Mangpa lungthahna zauhuoi na tung ua, ahing tun masangin, Mangpa lungthahna ni na tung ua, ahing tun masangin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa sui unlen, athutan na zui, nou leitunga mi kingaingiemte in, dihtatna sui unlen, nunnemna suiun, Mangpa lungthahna ni ah, phuolguh in na um theikha maw sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gaza khuo taisan in a um ding a, Ashkelon khuo ahawm a nuasie in a um dinga, Suntanglai in Ashdod khuo anotdoh ding uhi. Ekron khuo bawdoh in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi gei a teng Kereth namte Na tung uh agih hi, Aw Kanaan, Philistin mite gam Mangpa thuin noute ang dem hi Koima ateng ding umlou khop in, ka hing suse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuipi geite louhing pouna mun ahi ding a, Belam chingte tenna buh leh, belamte huong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuipi gei gamte khu Juda innkuon umsunte a ding ahi dinga, Khunah abelamhonte uh aching ding ua, Nitahlam chiengin Ashkelon innte ah a lum ding uhi. Aziehpen Mangpa a Pasian un, amauh ave dinga, asaltanna uapat apuikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moabte hing gensietna leh “Ammon mite hing simmawna ka zata a, Ka mite asimmaw ua, tualeh akigamgitpite u’tung ah, ki uongsah tahin avau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin ahin a ka hinlaisie,” “Moab Sodom bangin ka bawl dinga, tualeh Amon mite khu, Gomorrah bang ahi ngeingei ding uhi, Lahkhai pouna mun leh, chikhuh leh, kumtawn a luolou gam ahiden ding hi; Ka mi umsunten amauh gallah in, ala ding ua, Ka nam umsunten aluo ding uhi, Galkapte Mangpa Israelte Pasian in achi hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa mite tunga kiliensah tah a avau ziehun, alawtah ding uh tambang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ua dingin Mangpa khu, chizat huoitah ahi ding a, Leitung a pasiente zousie a sumang ding a, tualeh michin in ama umna mun chiet akipat, leh tuipi gei a namte zousie in Ama abe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nou Ethiopia mite zong, namsau a thain na um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Aman mallam douna in, akhut azahtou ding a, Assiria asumang ding hi, tualeh Nineveh khopi koima tennalou ahawm guoh, gamdai bangin a gaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alaikimtah ah ganhonte aboh ding ua, Gamsa namkim zong a boh ding uhi, Simbupi leh simbuneute, akhuompite ah agieh ding ua, Kotta ah, aw kilawmtah in la asa ding uhi; kotphung innhim ah sietna a um ding a, Sidar sing umte zong bangmalou asuohta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam khopi nuomsatah leh kimuong zou tah a khosa, alungtanga, “Keima ka hi, kei chilou koima a umsih hi” chinu khu Bangchia ahawm a hing um a, gamsate lupna mun hing suohdoh ata diei, Koi zong a kunga peikha poumain achilphitkhum ding ua, akhuttum uh alekhum ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Helhat leh polte nu, leh mi nuoisie hat khopi tung agih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amanu’n A aw angaikhe sih a, suhdihna zong apom sih a, Mangpa zong amuong sih a, a Pasian lam anai utsih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lah ua vaihawm liente, humpibahnei humham bang ahi ua, a vaihawmte lah nitahlam ngiete, zingmawng donga kheu ding, sagu nuasie lou bangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A guolneite lah mizumsuo hat leh, lepchie mite ahi ua, Asiempute un munsiengthou asubua ua, dan thu apalsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Alah ua um Mangpa khu adihtat a, Aman dihtatlouna abawl sih ding hi. Zingmawng chin in adihna vah ah akilang sah a, apelngai sih hi. Hinanleh midihtatlouten zumna athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ken namte ka sattanta a, akulpite uh akiphetse gawpta a, Ken a gawlzingte uh ahawm in ka umsah a, koima apeisuoh sih hi. Akhopite uh suhsiet in a umta a, Koima a umsih a, ateng zong a umsih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Adihtahin Kei na hing giing ding a, thuhilna na pom ngeingei ding, Tuachi’n bang chituh in gawt nanleng, atenna khopite uh susiet ahisih ding ka chi hi. Hinanleh zingmawng matahin athou ua, asilbawl zousie uh asusie uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Tuaziehin theipitu hi dinga, ka dindoh masangsie’n hing na ngah un,” Mangpa’n achi hi. “Ka siltup ahileh atung ua, Ka thangpaina leh, ka lungthahna zauhuoitah mai sunbuoh na ding a, leenggamte khopkhawm a, namte hatkhawm ahi. Leitung pumpi ka thangsietna meikuongah, akatum sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuahun chiengin mite kungah ham siengthou ka pe dinga, lungsim munkhat pua a Mangpa min, alaw theina ding u’leh ana asep theina dingun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ethiopia lui gallam a, Keima hing bie, akithezah ka mite tanuten, ka sillatte ahing tawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tuami ni chiengin ka tunga, na tatkhelna silbawlte ziehun na zum nawn sih ding ua, Tua hun chiengin na lah ua kipat in, na kisahtheina uh thangphatpite ka lamang dinga, ka taang siengthou ah kisatheitah in, na um thei nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lah uah mi kingaingiemte leh, nunnemte ka nuasie dinga, tuachi’n amaun Mangpa min a muong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel mi umsunten dihtatlouna abawl sih ding ua, zuou thu agen sih ding uhi, akam uah lepchiena thu akimu sih ding hi; amaun abelamhonte uh avah ding ua, alumsah ding ua, Koiman azausah nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />La sa in, Aw Zion tanu, Kikoukhie in Aw Israel! Aw Jerusalem tanu na lungtang teng teng a, kipah in nuomsa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na vaihawmnate Mangpa’n alamangta a, Na galte anotdohta hi. Israelte Lengpa, Mangpa na lah uah a um hi; vangsietna na tuoh nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Jerusalem kungah, “Zau sin, Zion, na khut zengan sih heh, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa na Pasian uh nalah uah a um hi, Mihatpa Aman ang hundam ding hi, na tungah nuom in akipah dinga, A itna in ang siemtha ding hi. La sa kawm in na tungah akipah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Na lah ua, akiguotsa khawmpi a tel phalou a, lungkhamte ka puikhawm ding a, Nangma zieh a gensietna puahgih pawte khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai vawi, tua hun chiengin nou hing sugentheite zousie, tungtang ken ka ngaituo ding a, Kengbaite ka hundam ding a, deldoh a umte ka puikhawm ding hi; tualeh maizumna leh zalatsah a aumna uh, gam chintengah, phatna leh minthanna ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hun chiengin noute ka hing, nua puilut kia ding a, Tua hun a ka hing puikhawm kia chiengin, Na mitmu ngel ua na saltanna ua kipat a, kang nua puikia hun chiengin, leitunga mizousie lah ah minthang leh, phat in ka hing umsah ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
